        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Rotate Footage\n\nRotates a clip by a fixed angle, which fixes phone footage that arrives on its side. It runs locally through ffmpeg with no API key or per-run cost.\n\n**How it works:** \"Clip\" takes your video. \"Rotate\" turns every frame by the angle set on the node, 90 degrees by default, and \"Result\" returns the rotated clip.\n\n**Try this:** Set the angle on \"Rotate\" to 180 to fix footage that was recorded upside down, or to 270 to turn it the other way."
        },
